// ColFindFirstBEUint8 searches for the first occurrence of a value in a contiguous array of
// big-endian 8 bit unsigned integers. The values must be sorted in ascending order. It returns
// the item number when found or the initial last value when not found, plus the lower bound of
// the searched value in first and last, or the upper bound for a FindLast search. It returns an
// error wrapping ErrNotMapped, ErrMisaligned or ErrOutOfRange, and the results of a value that
